# Home screen section order

Keep this top-to-bottom order in `home.page.html` unless the user explicitly asks to change it:

1. **Static CTAs** — `home-static-cta-card` (Start / Serve / Donate). See `home-static-ctas.mdc`.
2. **Platform CTAs** — `app-peek-carousel` for DB CTAs only (when any are active).
3. **Verse of the Day** — `app-verse-of-the-day-widget`
4. **Home GrovPods** — `app-home-tools-carousel` (Simple Budget, Goal Tracker, future home tools). One tool stays full width; two or more scroll sideways.
5. **Microlearning** — `@for` `app-microlearning-theme-widget` (Good Grief, Tools for Transformation, etc.)
6. **Share app card** — `app-home-share-app-card` (when not dismissed)
7. **Events & classes feed** — `.cards-container` / `app-card`

Do not move microlearning below the event feed or above static CTAs. Do not merge platform CTAs into the static card.
